<title>SPAIN: Reuters 5th ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 5th ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Madrid Spanish peseta air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			    Dec 17	     Nov 18</p>
<p>		    NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-JFK		  160		  160</p>
<p> MAD-CHI		  180		  185</p>
<p> MAD-LAX		  215		  210</p>
<p> MAD-MIA		  195		  200</p>
<p>		    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-MEX		  280		  270</p>
<p> MAD-BAI		  440		  450</p>
<p> MAD-RIO		  400		  410</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> MAD-DXB		  235		  250</p>
<p>		    FAR EAST</p>
<p> MAD-HKG		  255		  250</p>
<p> MAD-TYO		  365		  360</p>
<p>* These rates were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, general sales agents (GSAs) and freight forwarders.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
